ussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The method will also generate user friendly property titles from the names of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the generated properties. These titles can be modified by the user later as part of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the property definition customization."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note: This method attempts to automatically determine the required NSManagedObjectContext by querying the current app delegate. If your app delegate does not provide an NSManagedObjectContext, or if you’d like to provide a diffrerent one, please use initWithEntityName:managedObjectContext:autoGeneratePropertyDefinitions: instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"warning","type":"aside","name":"Warning"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCEntityDefinition"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/stv\/scentitydefinition\/initwithentityname:autogeneratepropertydefinitions:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns an initialized SCEntityDefinition given a Core Data entity name and the option to auto generate property definitions for the given entity’s properties."}],"references":{"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCEntityDefinition":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"SCEntityDefinition","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scentitydefinition","title":"SCEntityDefinition","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCEntityDefinition","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This class functions as a means to further extend the definition of user-defined Core Data entities."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Using entity definitions, classes like SCObjectCell and SCObjectSection"},{"text":" ",